{"id":416407,"date":"2026-10-27T15:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-10-27T13:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/?p=416407"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:55:50","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T13:55:50","slug":"fiecare-scoala-gimnaziala-din-cluj-napoca-va-primi-un-grant-de-cate-5-000-de-euro-elevii-vor-propune-idei-de-a-imbunatati-scoala-lor-si-vor-vota-singuri-proiectul-castigator-al-scolii-pana-pe-26-noi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/fiecare-scoala-gimnaziala-din-cluj-napoca-va-primi-un-grant-de-cate-5-000-de-euro-elevii-vor-propune-idei-de-a-imbunatati-scoala-lor-si-vor-vota-singuri-proiectul-castigator-al-scolii-pana-pe-26-noi\/","title":{"rendered":"Fiecare \u0219coal\u0103 gimnazial\u0103 din Cluj-Napoca va primi un grant de c\u00e2te 5.000 de euro \/ Elevii vor propune idei de a \u00eembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bi \u0219coala lor \u0219i vor vota singuri proiectul c\u00e2\u0219tig\u0103tor al \u0219colii p\u00e2n\u0103 pe 26 noiembrie, anun\u021b\u0103 primarul Emil Boc"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h5 id=\"fiecare-scoala-din-orasul-cluj-napoca-va-primi-o-finantare-de-cate-5-000-de-euro-pentru-un-proiect-decis-si-ales-de-elevii-sai-in-functie-de-nevoia-scolii-a-spus-primarul-emil-boc-intr-o-conferinta-d\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fiecare \u0219coal\u0103 din ora\u0219ul Cluj-Napoca va primi o finan\u021bare de c\u00e2te 5.000 de euro pentru un proiect decis \u0219i ales de elevii s\u0103i \u00een func\u021bie de nevoia \u0219colii, a spus primarul Emil Boc <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=qz2DAJAeUbA&amp;t=1392s\">\u00eentr-o conferin\u021b\u0103 de pres\u0103 din 21 octombrie. <\/a> \u201eElevii, pe de o parte, \u00ee\u0219i dezvolt\u0103 abilit\u0103\u021bile de comunicare, \u00ee\u0219i dezvolt\u0103 g\u00e2ndirea critic\u0103, g\u00e2ndirea antreprenorial\u0103, capacitatea de a lucra \u00een echip\u0103 \u0219i aduc un beneficiu pentru \u0219coala lor&#8221;, spune primarul. <\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201eFiecare \u0219coal\u0103 va primi un grant, va primi un premiu de 5.000 euro, dup\u0103 ce elevii vor discuta cum s\u0103 fac\u0103 proiectele, vor depune proiectele, le vor vota \u0219i cel care are cele mai multe voturi va fi implementat sus\u021binut financiar de prim\u0103rie. E un proiect unde adun\u0103m ideile bune ale copiilor din \u0219coli \u0219i iar pe cele mai bune pe care ei le voteaz\u0103, le premiem&#8221;, a explicat primarul ora\u0219ului Cluj-Napoca.  <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Toate cele 15 \u0219coli gimnaziale din Cluj (13 de limba rom\u00e2n\u0103 \u0219i dou\u0103 de limba maghiar\u0103) particip\u0103 la acest program. Practic, fiecare \u0219coal\u0103 va desf\u0103\u0219ura un concurs de proiecte \u00een \u0219coala lor: elevii vor lucra \u00een echip\u0103, vor c\u0103uta solu\u021bii de a \u00eembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bi \u0219coala cum cred ei \u0219i pe 26 noiembrie va fi votul final \u00een fiecare \u0219coal\u0103. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201eFiecare \u0219coal\u0103 va primi un grant, va primi un premiu de 5.000 euro, dup\u0103 ce elevii vor discuta cum s\u0103 fac\u0103 proiectele, vor depune proiectele, le vor vota \u0219i cel care are cele mai multe voturi va fi implementat sus\u021binut financiar de prim\u0103rie cu 5.000 euro. Asta ce \u00eenseamn\u0103? C\u0103 elevii, pe de o parte \u00ee\u0219i dezvolt\u0103 abilit\u0103\u021bile de comunicare, \u00ee\u0219i dezvolt\u0103 g\u00e2ndirea critic\u0103, g\u00e2ndirea antreprenorial\u0103, capacitatea de a lucra \u00een echip\u0103 \u0219i aduc un beneficiu pentru \u0219coala lor.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ei decid ce e mai necesar s\u0103 fac\u0103 cu 5.000 euro pentru \u0219coala lor. Nu noi ne impunem, ei lanseaz\u0103 idei, ei de le dezbat, ei le pun la vot, ei voteaz\u0103, ei decid, noi asigur\u0103m sus\u021binerea financiar\u0103&#8221;.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\u201eGrupul PONT, federa\u021bia tinerilor este facilitatorul care asigur\u0103 aceast\u0103 implementare a a proiectului \u0219i dintr-un total de aproximativ 20.000 de elevi din \u0219colile gimnaziale din Cluj, credem c\u0103 undeva \u00eentre 10 \u0219i 12.000 de elevi sunt implica\u021bi efectiv \u00een aceast\u0103 activitate de bugetare participativ\u0103.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A\u0219tept\u0103m data de 26 noiembrie \u00een fiecare \u0219coal\u0103 gimnazial\u0103 s\u0103 vedem ce rezultat este \u00een urma votului \u0219i dup\u0103 care ei vor implementa aceste proiecte pe care le-am men\u021bionat&#8221;, a mai spus Emil Boc. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">ID <a href=\"https:\/\/www.dreamstime.com\/group-diligent-school-kids-discussing-something-lesson-classroom-elementary-preteen-schoolchilds-working-groups-image476548631\">476548631<\/a> | <a href=\"https:\/\/www.dreamstime.com\/photos-images\/kids-group-brainstorming.html\">Kids Group Brainstorming<\/a> \u00a9 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.dreamstime.com\/jackf_info\">Iakov Filimonov<\/a> | <a href=\"https:\/\/www.dreamstime.com\/\">Dreamstime.com<\/a> \/ Dreamstime.com sprijin\u0103 educa\u0163ia din Rom\u00e2nia \u015fi ofer\u0103 gratuit imagini stock prin care Edupedu.ro \u00ee\u015fi poate ilustra articolele c\u00e2t mai relevant posibil \/ Campania Back to school ofer\u0103 posibilitatea oric\u0103rei \u0219coli, profesor sau elev s\u0103 descarce imagini de calitate cu 50% discount.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"Fiecare \u0219coal\u0103 din ora\u0219ul Cluj-Napoca va primi o finan\u021bare de c\u00e2te 5.000 de euro pentru un proiect decis \u0219i ales de elevii s\u0103i \u00een func\u021bie de nevoia \u0219colii, a spus&hellip;\n","protected":false},"author":190,"featured_media":416432,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_publicize_message":"","jetpack_publicize_feature_enabled":true,"jetpack_social_post_already_shared":true,"jetpack_social_options":{"image_generator_settings":{"template":"highway","default_image_id":0,"font":"","enabled":false},"version":2}},"categories":[647],"tags":[136784,136785,136783,136782],"class_list":["post-416407","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","category-stiri","tag-5-000-euro","tag-elevi-proiecte","tag-proiect-scoala","tag-proiecte-cluj-napoca"],"jetpack_publicize_connections":[],"views":{"total":188,"cached_at":"","cached_date":1793416688},"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/pajIe6-1Kkf","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_likes_enabled":true,"amp_enabled":true,"jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/cdn.edupedu.ro\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/dreamstime_l_476548631.jpg","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/416407","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/190"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=416407"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/416407\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":416434,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/416407\/revisions\/416434"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/416432"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=416407"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=416407"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.edupedu.ro\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=416407"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}